# Captain America's Shield ({2}, Equip {2}): equipped creature gets +0/+8 and has vigilance, so Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2) is a
# 0/10 that attacks without tapping (CR 702.20b). "Whenever equipped creature attacks, tap target creature defending player
# controls" (CR 508.5): Bot2's Ornithopter is the one legal target (the equipped one is not defending player's), so it is
# chosen at once and tapped. The Ornithopter deals no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Captain America's Shield
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Captain America's Shield.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Captain America's Shield.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 10
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 10
Bot2.Life = 20
